      }
    },
    "%lldd overdue" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已过期 %lld 天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 active reminder" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已开启 1 个提醒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 plant" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1 株植物"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 wild find" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1 条野外记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A better family tree" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更准确的家族树"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A bright spot just outside direct rays" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "明亮，但避开阳光直射"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A broad, heart-shaped blade with a notch at the base where the petiole attaches." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶片宽大，形似心脏；叶柄连接处有明显缺口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A bud contains undeveloped tissue that may become a shoot, leaf, or flower." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "芽里藏着尚未发育的组织，将来可能长成新枝、叶片或花。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A bud or shoot tip begins the next step" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "芽点或枝梢开始孕育新生长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A clean, dry scar is usually normal. A soft, dark, or spreading patch deserves a closer look." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "干燥整洁的叶痕通常正常；柔软、发黑或扩散的斑块需要仔细检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A cultivar is a named selection maintained through cultivation. It sits below the species in this practical plant address." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "栽培品种是经过人工选择并持续繁育、拥有专属名称的类型。在这份实用分类地址中，它位于物种之下。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A cycad, not a true palm" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它是苏铁，并不是真正的棕榈"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A damaged midrib can interrupt support and transport to a large part of the leaf." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主脉受损会影响大部分叶片的支撑和物质运输。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A family contains related genera. Araceae includes Monstera, Epipremnum, Philodendron, and many other aroids." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一个科包含多个相互关联的属。天南星科中有龟背竹属、麒麟叶属、喜林芋属等许多植物。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A family or genus can show that two plants share an evolutionary branch even when they look different." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "即使两株植物外观不同，同一个科或属也能告诉我们，它们共享一条演化分支。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A family relationship offers identification clues, but related plants can still need different care." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同科关系能提供辨认线索，但近亲植物的养护需求仍可能不同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A firm structural root supports the whole system. Soft or hollow sections may indicate damage or rot." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "结实的支撑根承托整个根系；柔软或中空的部位可能表示受损或腐烂。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A flower contains structures that help the plant reproduce and form seeds." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "花包含帮助植物繁殖并形成种子的结构。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A flowering plant, not a true fern" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它是开花植物，并不是真正的蕨类"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A fresh start" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "生命的起点"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A gentle reminder to see whether it needs water." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "看看土壤是否需要浇水。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A genus brings together closely related species. It is the first word in a scientific species name." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一个属汇集了亲缘关系较近的多个物种。属名是科学名称中的第一个词。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A heart-like base notch" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶基有心形缺口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A leaf scar marks the place where a leaf or its petiole was once attached to the stem." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶痕标记叶片或叶柄曾经与茎连接的位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A long, narrow blade that is widest below the middle and tapers to a pointed tip." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶片细长，中部偏下最宽，并逐渐收尖。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A mature plant gains the ability to reproduce through flowers, cones, or spores, though indoor conditions may not trigger them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "植物成熟后便具备通过花、球果或孢子繁殖的能力，不过室内环境不一定能促使它们出现。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A move, cold draft, heat source, or sharp light change can trigger leaf drop." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "搬动位置、冷风、热源或光照骤变，都可能引起落叶。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A named cultivated selection. It uses quotes and is not italicized." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "经过人工选择并命名的栽培类型。名称要加引号，但不用斜体。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new leaf begins in a protected growing region. On many vining plants, look near the shoot tip or a node where a leaf joins the stem." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新叶会从受到保护的生长区域开始发育。对于许多藤本植物，可以在枝梢或叶片与茎相连的茎节附近寻找。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new moment" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "记录新瞬间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new sighting" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "又一次相遇"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A node is a growth point where a leaf, bud, branch, or root can emerge." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "节是植物的生长点，叶、芽、枝条或根都可能从这里长出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A node is the point where a leaf or bud attaches to a stem. New branches and roots can also begin there." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "茎节是叶片或芽与茎相连的位置，新枝和根也可能从这里长出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A piece of stem produces roots and a new shoot. This is common for many vining and trailing houseplants, but the location of the node matters." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "茎段会长出根和新芽。许多藤本、垂吊植物都适合茎插，但茎节的位置非常关键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A plant can have palm-like leaves without being a flowering palm. Sago palm is a cycad." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶子像棕榈，并不代表它就是开花植物中的棕榈。铁树其实属于苏铁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A plant may temporarily droop when it loses water faster than its roots can replace it." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当水分流失速度超过根系吸收速度时，植物可能会暂时下垂。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A plant often uses less water when growth slows or available light decreases." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "植物生长放缓或光照减少时，通常也会减少用水。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A receptive stigma allows pollination to begin when compatible pollen reaches it." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "合适的花粉落到成熟的柱头上后，授粉过程便可以开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A reminder tells you when to check your plant. The plant and potting mix tell you whether to water." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提醒只是告诉你何时检查；是否真的需要浇水，要由植物和盆土状态决定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A request is sent only after you tap Suggest with AI. Tapping it again sends another request and may create another charge." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只有你轻点“让 AI 帮我补全”后，PlantStory 才会发送请求。再次轻点会重新请求，并可能产生额外费用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A saw-toothed margin" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶缘像锯齿"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A shared name used for more than one Monstera" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个俗名可能指不止一种龟背竹属植物"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A simple workflow" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "简单四步"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A single blade with deep rounded or pointed indentations that form distinct sections." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一整片叶上有较深的圆形或尖形凹口，看起来像被分成数瓣。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A soft or discolored stem can point to damage, disease, or excess moisture." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "茎变软或变色，可能说明植物受伤、患病或水分过多。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A species name usually leads to more precise care and identification information than a broad common name." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "相比宽泛的俗名，物种名称通常能帮你找到更准确的养护和识别资料。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A sudden change" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "环境突然变化"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A sudden move into strong direct light can leave pale, tan, or brown damaged patches." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "突然移到强烈直射光下，叶片可能出现浅色、黄褐色或褐色的受损斑块。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A suitable grow light can help in a dim spot. Follow its distance and timing instructions, and give plants a daily dark period." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光线不足时，可以使用合适的植物灯。按照说明设置距离和时长，并让植物每天有一段黑暗时间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A symptom is a clue, not a diagnosis. Check the soil, light, roots, and leaves before changing care." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "症状只是线索，并非确切诊断。调整养护方式前，先检查土壤、光照、根系和叶片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A very dry root ball or damaged roots can make a plant shed leaves." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根团过于干燥或根系受损，会导致植物落叶。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A visible flower or fruit is the clearest clue, but either may be absent outside the plant’s reproductive season." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "看见花或果实是最直观的线索，但不在繁殖季节时，两者都可能暂时看不到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A whole leaf, petiole, or leaf section can form a new plant in certain species. Other plants may grow roots from a leaf but never produce a shoot." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "某些植物可以用完整叶片、叶柄或叶片切段繁殖；另一些植物的叶片即使长根，也不会冒出新芽。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A young plant builds roots, stems, and leaves. In some species, juvenile leaves look different from adult leaves." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "幼株会专注长根、茎和叶。有些植物幼年期的叶片与成年后的样子并不相同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ABOUT" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
