        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "授粉后，花粉管会沿着花柱向胚珠生长。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After successful pollination, the ovary of many plants develops into a fruit." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "成功授粉后，许多植物的子房会逐渐发育成果实。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After the main tip is pruned, a healthy axillary bud may begin growing and make the plant branch." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
