    },
    "AI can confuse plants with similar common names. No photo was analyzed, so review the species and description before applying them." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅凭名称，AI 可能会认错同名或相似的植物。这里不会分析照片，请在采用前核对物种和描述。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI can confuse plants with similar common names. No photo was analyzed, so review the species, taxonomy, and field guide before applying them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 可能会混淆俗名相近的植物。本次未分析照片，请在采用前核对物种、分类信息和野外图鉴。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI can suggest a species and short botanical description—not a care guide. Each request uses your OpenAI API credits, and you’ll review the result before applying it." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 可以帮你推测物种并生成简短的植物介绍，但不会提供养护指南。每次生成都会消耗你自己的 OpenAI API 额度，采用前可以先查看内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI can suggest a species, structured field guide, and taxonomy—not a care guide. Each request uses your OpenAI API credits, and you’ll review the result before applying it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AI 可以帮你推测物种、生成结构化野外图鉴和分类信息，但不会提供养护指南。每次生成都会消耗你自己的 OpenAI API 额度，采用前可以先查看内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
