    "Aluminum plant" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "花叶冷水花"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An aerial root grows from an above-ground stem and may help a climbing plant attach to support." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "气生根从地上茎长出，可帮助攀援植物附着在支撑物上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An aroid, not a true lily" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它是天南星科植物，并不是真正的百合"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An axillary bud is a small growth point that can develop into a side shoot or, in some plants, a flower." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "腋芽是一个小生长点，可以发育成侧枝，在某些植物上也能发育成花。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An established clump is separated into smaller plants. Each division begins with both growing points and roots, so it does not need to build a root system from a bare cutting." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把成熟的丛生植株分成几株小苗。每份分株都保留生长点和根，不必像裸插穗那样从头长根。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An occasional older leaf may yellow and drop. Several leaves changing quickly deserve a closer check." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "偶尔一片老叶变黄脱落并不罕见；如果多片叶子短时间内一起变化，就要仔细检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An old label may use Sansevieria for snake plants, but accepted classifications now place them in Dracaena." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "旧标签可能把虎尾兰写成 Sansevieria，但目前接受的分类已将它们归入龙血树属 Dracaena。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An older lower leaf may yellow and fall while the rest of the plant remains healthy." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "较老的下部叶片可能自然变黄脱落，而植株其他部分仍然健康。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An oval blade that is widest around the middle and narrows toward both ends." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶片呈椭圆形，中部最宽，两端逐渐变窄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An ovule is a small structure inside the ovary that can develop into a seed." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "胚珠是子房内的小结构，受精后可以发育成种子。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An uneven leaf base—one side larger than the other—is a classic begonia clue." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶基左右不对称、一侧明显较大，是辨认秋海棠的经典线索。"
          }
        }
      }
