            "value" : "天门冬（Asparagus fern）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avoid keeping potting mix constantly wet. Use drainage holes and remove fallen leaves from the soil surface." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不要让盆土一直潮湿。确保花盆排水通畅，并及时清理土面的落叶。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Avoid sudden swings in watering, temperature, or light while new growth is developing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新芽生长期间，尽量避免浇水、温度或光照突然大幅变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Axillary bud" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
