    "Bamburanta" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bamburanta"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Banyan" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "孟加拉榕"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Before using any pest-control product, confirm it is labeled for indoor use and for your plant. Follow the label and test a small area first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用任何除虫产品前，请确认标签注明可用于室内和这类植物。严格按说明使用，并先在小范围测试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Before you start" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "动手之前"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Beginner note" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新手提示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Begonia family" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "秋海棠科"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Begonias differ greatly in leaf texture and growth habit, so identify the type before choosing care." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不同秋海棠的叶片质地和生长习性差别很大，先确认类型再决定养护方式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "BELOW THE SOIL" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "土壤之下"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Best fertilizing months" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "适合施肥的月份"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Best pruning months" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "适合修剪的月份"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Black or mushy tips, repeated deformity, spreading discoloration, pests, or several symptoms together call for a full care check." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果新芽发黑发软、反复畸形、变色范围扩大、发现害虫，或多种症状同时出现，就要全面检查养护环境。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Black velvet alocasia" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Black velvet alocasia"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Black-gold philodendron" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Black-gold philodendron"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Black, mushy, foul-smelling, or collapsing tissue suggests rot. Remove damaged material and review moisture, cleanliness, and airflow." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "组织发黑、软烂、有异味或塌陷，通常提示腐烂。去掉受损部分，并检查湿度、清洁和通风是否合适。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bleached areas, pale patches, curling, or dry scorched spots can appear when light is too intense." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光照过强时，叶片可能褪色、出现浅色斑块、卷曲或留下干枯焦斑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bloomed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开花啦"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blushing philodendron" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "红苞喜林芋"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Boston fern, bird’s-nest fern, maidenhair fern, and horsetails." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "波士顿蕨、鸟巢蕨、铁线蕨和木贼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both approaches can work for some plants. Follow the method recommended for your species rather than choosing only by appearance." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有些植物两种方式都能成功。应按品种推荐的方法选择，而不是只看哪种更好看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both very dry and persistently wet soil can cause leaves to curl." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "土壤过干或长期过湿，都可能导致叶片卷曲。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bright indirect light" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "明亮散射光"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bright, indirect light" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "明亮散射光"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Brighter conditions often help the plant and potting mix use water faster." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光照越充足，植物和盆土通常越快消耗水分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Broad group" : {
