            "value" : "养护建议"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Care notes" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "养护要点"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Caring guide" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "养护指南"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cast-iron plant" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "蜘蛛抱蛋"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change one thing at a time, then give the plant time to respond. Several different problems can create the same symptom." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次只调整一项，并留出时间观察植物的反应。不同问题可能会表现出相同症状。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changes apply immediately across PlantStory." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "切换后立即生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changes in leaf color, shape, or firmness are often early signs of stress." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶片颜色、形状或硬挺程度的变化，常常是植物受压的早期信号。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check %@’s soil" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "看看%@的土壤"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check a reliable, species-specific guide before removing anything from the parent plant." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从母株剪下任何部位之前，先查阅可靠的品种专属繁殖指南。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check again after a day or two. Notice how the pot’s weight and the feel of the mix change as it dries." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一两天后再检查，并留意盆土变干时，手感和花盆重量如何变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check before you water" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "浇水前先检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check fallen leaves for yellowing, spots, pests, or soft tissue." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "检查掉落的叶片是否发黄、有斑点、虫害或组织软烂。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check first" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先检查这些"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check first. Water fully." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先检查，再浇透。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check leaf undersides, growing tips, and the joints where leaves meet stems. Use bright light to spot webbing." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "检查叶背、生长点和叶片与茎的连接处。借助明亮光线更容易发现细网。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check soil moisture at root depth rather than only at the surface." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "检查根系深度的土壤湿度，不要只看表面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check stems and leaf undersides before buying or bringing a plant indoors, then quarantine new arrivals." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "购买植物或搬回室内前，检查茎和叶背；新到的植物要先单独观察。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the newest leaves" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "检查最新长出的叶片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the spot at several times of day to see whether direct rays actually reach the leaves." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在一天中的不同时间查看这个位置，确认阳光是否会直接照到叶片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check whether spots are dry and bleached or soft and spreading." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "观察斑点是干燥褪色，还是柔软并继续扩散。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check whether the soil has been staying dry for long periods." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "检查土壤是否已经长时间处于干燥状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check whether yellowing is limited to older lower leaves or is spreading." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "看看发黄是否只出现在下部老叶，还是正在扩散。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check-in interval" : {
      "localizations" : {
