    "Chinese money plant, aluminum plant, artillery plant, and true nettles." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "镜面草、铝叶冷水花、小叶冷水花和真正的荨麻。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a clean draining pot and lightly moisten fresh potting mix." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选好干净且排水通畅的花盆，将新盆土稍微润湿。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a healthy, preferably non-flowering stem with the number of nodes recommended for the species. A node is where a leaf or bud joins the stem." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择健康、最好没有开花的茎，并按品种要求保留足够茎节。茎节就是叶片或芽与茎相连的位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a little boost for future PlantStory ideas." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果你愿意，可以为 PlantStory 的下一个点子浇点水。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a month for seasonal care. Watering shows plants due today or overdue." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择月份查看季节性养护；浇水会显示今天到期或已逾期的植物。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a month to see the plants that need seasonal care." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择月份，看看哪些植物需要养护。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a natural clump with more than one growing point. Plan sections so every new plant keeps healthy shoots and roots." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择带有多个生长点的自然丛生植株，分开时确保每株小苗都保留健康枝叶和根。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a pest" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择一种害虫"
