          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Common example" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "常见例子"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Common name" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "常见名称"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Common names are useful, but they can vary by region or point to several different plants." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "俗名很实用，但不同地区的叫法可能不同，同一个名字也可能指多种植物。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "COMMON PEST" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "常见害虫"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Common pests" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "常见害虫"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Common-name surprises" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "俗名里的意外答案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compare length with width. It should be much longer than it is wide and taper gradually." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "比较叶片的长和宽：长度明显大于宽度，并且逐渐变尖。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compare size, spacing, color, and shape with older leaves. A repeated pattern of smaller or distorted leaves can signal stress." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把新叶的大小、间距、颜色和形状与老叶对比。如果新叶持续偏小或畸形，可能说明植物正承受压力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Compare the plant’s current light with the conditions it normally prefers." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "确认植物目前的光照是否符合它平时喜欢的环境。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Completely optional. Tips do not unlock features or change how PlantStory works." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "完全自愿。支持不会解锁额外功能，也不会改变 PlantStory 的使用方式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cones are a strong clue. Needle-like leaves are common among conifers, while cycads and ginkgo show that the group has other leaf shapes too." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "球果是一个明显线索。针叶在松柏类中很常见，但苏铁和银杏也说明裸子植物并不只有这一种叶形。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Confidence" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可信度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Configure your OpenAI API key" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "管理 OpenAI API 密钥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Confirm that drainage holes are open and empty any water collected inside the saucer or decorative outer pot." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "确认排水孔畅通，并倒掉托盘或装饰套盆里的积水。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Constantly wet soil can reduce oxygen around the roots and cause leaves to yellow." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "土壤长期潮湿会减少根系周围的氧气，从而导致叶片发黄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Continue until some water exits the drainage holes. Very dry mix may need a second slow pass." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "继续浇到少量水从排水孔流出。盆土过干时，可能需要再慢慢浇一遍。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Contrasting dots or patches repeat across the blade as part of the leaf’s normal coloring." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "对比色的斑点或斑块有规律地分布在叶面上，属于叶片本身的正常花纹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
