            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "反馈"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feeding insects, rubbing, or bruising can leave scattered marks that resemble disease." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "害虫取食、摩擦或碰伤都可能留下零散斑痕，看起来与病害相似。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feel the potting mix at the depth your plant prefers and notice whether the pot feels light or heavy." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "摸一摸植物适合的盆土深度，同时感受花盆是轻还是沉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feel the soil below the surface before watering again." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "再次浇水前，先摸一摸表层以下的土壤。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Feel the soil first; do not assume every drooping plant needs water." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先摸土壤，不要看到植物下垂就直接认定它缺水。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fenestrated" : {
