    "Gently tease apart the outer roots if they are tightly circling the root ball." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果外层根系紧密盘绕，轻轻将它们拨松。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gently tease or make a clean cut between sections, keeping roots attached. Pot each division at about the same depth it was growing before." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "沿分株之间轻轻拨开或整齐切开，尽量保留根系；重新上盆时保持与原来接近的栽种深度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Genus" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "属"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get a gentle reminder to check the soil." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按时提醒你查看土壤状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ginseng fig" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "榕树"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Give it space and resist touching it often. Keep the plant away from abrupt drafts, heat, or strong new sunlight." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "给新叶留出空间，别频繁触碰，并避开突然的穿堂风、热源或骤然增强的阳光。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Give roots room to breathe." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "给根系留出呼吸和生长的空间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Give the propagule useful light without harsh direct sun that can dry or scorch tender growth." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "给繁殖苗充足但柔和的光线，避开会让幼嫩组织失水或灼伤的强烈直射阳光。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glorious philodendron" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Glorious philodendron"
