            "value" : "生长阶段"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Guide longer aerial roots toward a support or potting mix when helpful. They are normal growth, not a pest." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "较长的气生根可按需引向支撑物或盆土。它们是正常生长，并非害虫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gymnosperms" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "裸子植物"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gymnosperms are seed plants, but their seeds are not enclosed inside fruits. Many familiar gymnosperms produce cones." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "裸子植物会产生种子，但种子并不包在果实里面。许多常见裸子植物会长出球果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Habitat" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "生境"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Healthy branching gives the plant more access to moisture while helping hold it securely in the pot." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "健康的分枝让植物接触更多水分，也帮助它稳固在花盆中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Healthy roots" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "健康根系"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Healthy roots are usually firm. Dark, mushy roots can be a sign of rot." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "健康的根通常结实有韧性；发黑、软烂可能是烂根的迹象。"
