    "Hybrid sign" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "杂交符号"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I understand API requests are billed to my OpenAI API account." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "我了解：API 请求产生的费用将由我的 OpenAI API 账户支付。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Identify the node, leaf, rooted division, or offset required by your chosen method." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根据所选方法，找准需要的茎节、叶片、带根分株或侧芽。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Identify the pest before treating. Different problems can leave similar marks on a plant." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先确认害虫种类再处理。不同问题可能会在植物上留下相似痕迹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Identifying features" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "识别特征"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If this plant prefers to dry to this depth, water slowly and evenly until excess drains from the bottom." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果这种植物适合干到这个程度再浇水，就缓慢、均匀地浇透，直到多余水分从盆底流出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If watering has become difficult or growth has slowed, move up one pot size and gently loosen the outer circling roots." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果浇水越来越困难或生长变慢，可以换大一号花盆，并轻轻松开外层盘绕的根。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Imagine an ellipse: both sides curve smoothly, with no base notch or deep lobes." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "想象一个椭圆：两侧弧线平滑，叶基没有缺口，叶缘也没有深裂。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In %lld days" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld 天后"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In a cutaway flower, ovules appear as small pale shapes inside the ovary." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在花朵剖面中，胚珠是子房内一个个浅色的小结构。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In memory" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "纪念"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspect and trim" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "检查并修剪"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspect both sides of several leaves with bright light." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在明亮光线下检查几片叶子的正反两面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspect curled edges, leaf undersides, and new growth for tiny pests or webbing." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "检查卷曲的叶缘、叶背和新芽，寻找小虫或蛛网状痕迹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspect curled young leaves, buds, tender stems, and leaf undersides. Ants or sticky surfaces can be extra clues." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "检查卷曲的嫩叶、花苞、嫩茎和叶背。蚂蚁或发黏的叶面也可能是线索。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspect leaves weekly, clean dusty foliage, and avoid letting the plant remain severely dry or stressed." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每周检查叶片，及时清理积尘，并避免植株长期严重缺水或处于压力状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspect soil moisture and roots before changing the watering schedule." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "调整浇水安排前，先检查土壤湿度和根系。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspect stems, leaf veins, and leaf undersides. Compare suspicious bumps with normal stem texture." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "检查茎、叶脉和叶背，并把可疑凸点与植株本身的正常纹理作比较。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspect tender growth often and quarantine new plants, cuttings, or plants returning from outdoors." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "经常检查嫩芽，并把新植物、插条或刚从室外搬回的植物先单独观察。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Inspect visible roots and confirm that excess water can drain from the pot." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "检查看得到的根系，并确认多余水分可以从盆底排出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install PlantStory, open Storage & Data, and choose Restore from Backup. Apple Quick Start or a full device backup also works." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "安装 PlantStory 后，打开“存储与数据”，选择“从备份恢复”。也可以使用 Apple 快速开始或完整的设备备份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Internode" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "节间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Introduce stronger light a little at a time, especially before placing an indoor plant outside." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一点点增加光照强度，尤其不要把室内植物突然搬到户外强光下。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Iron cross begonia" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "马蹄秋海棠"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Is it time to repot?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该换盆了吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Isolate the plant. Gently wipe or lift off visible scale if the plant tolerates it, and prune heavily infested growth." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先隔离植株。如果植株耐受，可轻轻擦掉或挑除可见虫体，并剪去受害严重的枝叶。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Isolate the plant. Remove visible insects with a damp cotton swab, rinse sturdy leaves, and repeat checks because hidden bugs can return." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先隔离植株。用湿棉签清除看得见的虫体，冲洗较结实的叶片，并反复检查，因为藏起来的粉蚧可能再次出现。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Isolate the plant. Rinse foliage, remove badly damaged flowers or leaves, and repeat close inspections because thrips hide in crevices." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先隔离植株。冲洗叶片，剪去受损严重的花或叶，并反复仔细检查，因为蓟马会躲在缝隙中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Isolate the plant. Rinse leaves thoroughly, especially underneath, wipe away webbing, and inspect again every few days." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先隔离植株。彻底冲洗叶片，尤其是叶背，擦掉细网，并每隔几天重新检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Isolate the plant. Wash aphids off with water and remove badly infested tips. Repeat the inspection as new growth opens." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先隔离植株。用水冲掉蚜虫，剪去受害严重的嫩梢，并随着新叶展开继续检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It gives you a precise word for a very common leaf shape and helps narrow down similar plants." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是很常见的叶形。学会准确描述它，可以更快排除相似植物。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It improves your search" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "让搜索结果更准确"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is the main green surface extending outward from the petiole and midrib." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它是从叶柄和主脉向外展开的主要绿色表面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It may be time to water" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可能该浇水了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It reveals relationships" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "看见植物之间的亲缘关系"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It travels across languages" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "跨越语言也能对上号"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It’s been %lld days since the last watering." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "距离上次浇水已经 %lld 天了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It’s been a day since the last watering." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "距离上次浇水已经一天了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its notes, photos, and timeline will also be removed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它的笔记、照片和成长记录也会一并删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its notes, photos, watering history, and fertilizing history will also be removed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它的笔记、照片、浇水和施肥记录也会一并删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its photos and timeline will also be removed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "相关照片和发现记录也会一并删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its strong length-to-width ratio separates it from elliptic and oval leaves." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "明显偏长的比例，可以把它与椭圆形或卵形叶区分开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its taxonomy path" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它的分类路径"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jade necklace" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jade necklace"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jade plant" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "玉树"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jade plant, flaming Katy, Echeveria, Sedum, and Aeonium." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "玉树、长寿花、拟石莲花属、景天属和莲花掌属。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Juvenile phase" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "幼年阶段"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep affected leaves dry and give the plant space for air to move around it." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持受影响的叶片干燥，并给植物留出通风空间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep care steady" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持养护稳定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep in mind" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请留意"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep light, watering, and temperature appropriate for the species. Avoid making several major care changes at once." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根据品种保持合适的光照、浇水和温度，不要一次同时大改多项养护条件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the crown near the plant's original planting depth. Burying it too deeply can trap moisture." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "让根颈保持在植物原来的种植深度附近；埋得过深可能积聚水分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the part you need intact. Remove only leaves that would sit below water or the medium." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保留繁殖所需的完整结构，只去掉会浸在水里或埋进基质的叶片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the root ball intact unless another problem needs attention. If you are repotting, use fresh suitable mix and avoid a needlessly large pot." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果没有其他问题，不必打散根团。需要换盆时，使用新鲜合适的盆土，也不要选过大的花盆。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the rooting medium evenly moist and airy. Constantly soggy conditions can encourage rot." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "让生根基质均匀湿润并保持透气，长期湿漉漉容易引起腐烂。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep the same depth" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保持原有栽种深度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep this file somewhere safe. You can restore it from Storage & Data on another iPhone." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请妥善保存备份文件。换到新 iPhone 后，可在“存储与数据”中恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep watching the whole plant rather than chasing perfect leaves. Record changes over time if a pattern concerns you." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关注整株植物的状态，不必追求每片叶子都完美。如果某种变化反复出现，可以记录下来持续观察。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kentia palm" : {
