    },
    "Leaf tip" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶尖"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leaf tips or edges are becoming dry, crisp, and brown." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶尖或叶缘逐渐变干、变脆并呈褐色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Learn about roots, stems, leaves, and flowers." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "认识植物的根、茎、叶和花。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Learn four common ways to make a new plant, what each method needs, and how to care for it while roots develop." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "认识四种常见繁殖方法，了解各自需要什么，以及新根长出期间该怎样照顾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Learn how plants work, spot common problems, and care with confidence." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "了解植物如何生长，读懂常见问题，更有信心地照顾它们。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Learn the clues that help describe and identify leaves." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "学会观察叶形和特征，更容易描述和辨认叶片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Learn the language\nof plants." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "读懂植物的\n生长语言。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Learn the visual clues of common houseplant pests and what to check next." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "认识室内植物常见害虫的外观线索，并了解接下来该检查什么。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Learn to describe what you see." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "学会准确描述眼前的叶片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Learn what common light labels mean, observe how light moves through your home, and notice when a plant wants a change." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "看懂常见的光照说法，观察阳光如何进入家中，并留意植物何时需要换个位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Learn what healthy roots look like, when a plant needs more space, and how to repot without guesswork." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "认识健康根系，判断植物何时需要更大空间，并一步步学会换盆。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Learn when to water, how to check the pot, and what changes the schedule." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "了解何时该浇水、如何检查盆土，以及哪些因素会改变浇水频率。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Learn where growth begins, what changes as a leaf opens, and which signals deserve a closer look." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "了解新芽从哪里长出、叶片展开时会发生什么，以及哪些信号值得进一步检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leaves and stems are hanging lower than usual or feel soft and limp." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶片和茎比平时更下垂，摸起来柔软无力。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leaves are often fleshy, while tiny flowers gather on narrow upright spikes." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶片常带肉质，细小花朵聚集在直立的细长花穗上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leaves are turning pale or yellow on one part of the plant or across the whole plant." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "植物局部或整株的叶片正在变淡或发黄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leaves are usually flat green structures growing from stems or branches." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶通常是从茎或枝条上长出的扁平绿色结构。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leaves capture light to make sugars and exchange gases with the air." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶片吸收光线制造糖分，同时与空气交换气体。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leaves develop many tiny pale dots, then may look bronze or dry. Fine webbing can appear when numbers grow." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶面会出现密集的浅色小点，随后可能变成铜褐色或干枯。虫量增多时，还会看到细细的网。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leaves falling unexpectedly" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶片异常脱落"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leaves frequently show clear veins; Pilea species often have small, inconspicuous flowers." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶脉通常很清楚；冷水花属的花朵往往很小，不太显眼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leaves have distinct dark, pale, yellow, or water-soaked patches." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶片上出现明显的深色、浅色、黄色或水渍状斑块。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leaves may curl to reduce moisture loss in hot or low-humidity conditions." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在高温或低湿度环境中，叶片可能通过卷曲来减少水分流失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leaves often unfold from sheathing stalks and may lift or fold as light changes." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶片常从包裹状叶柄中展开，并会随光线变化抬起或合拢。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leaves or flowers develop silvery scraped patches, streaks, distortion, or tiny black specks. The insects are narrow and difficult to see." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶片或花朵会出现银白色擦痕、条斑、变形或黑色小点。蓟马身体细长，很难直接看清。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let it open on its own" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "让叶片自己展开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let the leaf open by itself. Do not peel, pull, or rub the tender blade." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "让叶片自然展开，不要剥、拉或揉搓幼嫩的叶面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let the pot finish draining, then discard water from its saucer or decorative outer pot." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "等花盆沥干后，倒掉托盘或装饰套盆里的水。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let the top layer of mix dry as much as the plant safely allows, clear decaying debris, and use sticky cards to reduce and monitor adults." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在植物能够承受的范围内，让盆土表层充分变干，清除腐烂杂物，并用粘虫板减少和监测成虫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Library/Application Support/PlantStory/plants.json" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Library/Application Support/PlantStory/plants.json"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Library/Application Support/PlantStory/wild-finds.json" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Library/Application Support/PlantStory/wild-finds.json"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Life timeline" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "成长足迹"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Light" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光照"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LIGHT LEVEL" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光照强度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Light Made Simple" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "轻松看懂光照"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Light or nutrient stress" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光照或养分不足"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Light usually becomes weaker as a plant moves farther from a window." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "植物离窗户越远，接收到的光通常越弱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Light, location, milestones…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光照、摆放位置、成长变化…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lipstick echeveria" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lipstick echeveria"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loading support options…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在加载支持选项…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lobed" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "裂叶"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Local-only storage · No cloud sync" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只存本机 · 不上云"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Location (optional)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "摆放位置（可选）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Location for this sighting…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这次是在哪里发现的？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Long dry periods or very dry air can leave delicate leaf tips crisp." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "土壤长期干燥或空气过于干燥，会让脆弱的叶尖变得干焦。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Long, narrow, and pointed" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "细长，末端尖"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Long, thin growth, leaning toward a window, smaller new leaves, fading color, or fewer flowers can be clues." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "枝茎细长、向窗户倾斜、新叶变小、叶色变淡或开花减少，都可能是光照不足的迹象。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look at the top of the central structure, often above the surrounding anthers." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "观察花朵中央结构的顶端，它通常高于周围的花药。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look closely at how a leaf is built to collect light." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仔细看看叶片由哪些结构组成，又如何接收光线。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look first at the base. The two rounded sides meet around a clear inward notch." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先看叶基：两侧圆弧在明显的内凹处相接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look for a firm green or brown nub emerging from a node, often opposite a leaf." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在节上寻找坚实的绿色或棕色小突起，通常位于叶片对面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look for a flower structure made of a central spike called a spadix, often wrapped by a leaflike spathe." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "留意中央棒状的肉穗花序，外面常包着一片像叶子的佛焰苞。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look for a joint or slight ring where a leaf meets the main stem." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶片与主茎相接处常有一个关节状或略微隆起的环。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look for a small pointed bud, swelling, or fresh tip. Compare it with nearby older growth so you can recognize what is new." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "寻找小小的尖芽、鼓起处或颜色鲜嫩的枝梢，并与附近较老的部分对比，就更容易认出新生长。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look for a small, tightly closed point near a node or at a stem tip." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在节附近或茎尖寻找小小的、尚未展开的尖状结构。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look for a smooth, pale or cream-colored point at the end of a healthy young root." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在健康幼根末端寻找光滑、浅色或乳白色的尖端。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look for a white mineral crust on the soil or around the pot." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "看看土面或花盆周围是否有白色矿物盐结晶。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look for an established start" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "确认根系已经站稳脚跟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look for firm healthy roots and remove roots that are clearly dead, soft, or damaged using clean shears." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "检查结实健康的根，用干净剪刀剪掉明显坏死、柔软或受损的根。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look for low mats or small leafy forms in moist places. Fine stalks with capsules may rise above a moss when it is producing spores." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它们常在湿润处形成贴地的绒毯或小片叶状体。苔藓产生孢子时，细长的柄顶端可能会长出孢蒴。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look for medium-sized roots growing sideways from a thicker structural root." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "寻找从较粗支撑根侧面长出的中等粗细根。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look for nearby heaters, vents, or intense sunlight that may be drying the plant." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "查看附近是否有暖气、风口或强烈阳光使植物变干。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look for obstructions" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "留意遮挡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look for several slender stalks arranged around the central pistil." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "雌蕊周围排列着的几根细长结构就是雄蕊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look for the broad, often colorful structures that open as the flower blooms." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "花朵绽放时展开的宽大彩色结构通常就是花瓣。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look for the small green, leaflike structures directly behind or beneath the petals." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "花瓣后面或下方那些绿色、像小叶片的结构就是萼片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look for the thick line running from the petiole toward the leaf tip." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从叶柄一路延伸到叶尖的粗线就是主脉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look for the yellow or dusty-looking shape at the end of each slender filament." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每根细长花丝末端黄色或带粉末的部分就是花药。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look in leaf axils, along stems and veins, under leaves, and around tight crevices near the pot rim." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重点查看叶腋、茎、叶脉、叶背，以及盆沿附近的狭小缝隙。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look just above the place where a petiole meets the stem at a node." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在叶柄与茎相接的节上方寻找。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look more closely" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "需要仔细检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Look under leaves, inside flowers, around buds, and in tight folds. Check damaged areas for slender insects and black specks." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "查看叶背、花朵内部、花苞周围和紧密褶皱处，并在受损区域寻找细长小虫和黑色小点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lookalikes" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "相似植物"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loose pollen near anthers is usually a normal part of flowering, not a pest." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "花药附近散落的花粉通常是正常开花现象，并不是害虫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Loosen circling roots" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "松开盘绕根系"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Low light" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "低光照"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Low-light tolerant means the plant can cope—not that it will grow quickly. Watch for stretching, small leaves, or fading color." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "耐低光照只代表植物能够适应，并不代表它会长得快。要留意徒长、新叶变小或叶色变淡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
