    "Manual backup & restore" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "手动备份和恢复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Many have divided fronds. Mature fronds may carry clusters of spore-producing structures, often visible as dots or lines on the underside." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "许多蕨类有分裂的叶片。成熟叶片背面常能看到点状或线状的孢子囊群。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Many plants still carry Calathea on shop labels even when their accepted genus is Goeppertia." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不少植物目前接受的属名已是 Goeppertia，但商店标签仍常沿用 Calathea。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Many stem cuttings need at least one node before they can produce new growth." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "许多茎插繁殖都需要保留至少一个节，才能长出新芽或新根。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Many tropical foliage plants favor this range. A sheer curtain can soften stronger window light." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "许多热带观叶植物喜欢这个范围。光线太强时，可以用薄纱帘柔化阳光。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Match the method to the plant" : {
