    "Milky latex is common. Ficus plants often have woody stems and prominent leaf scars." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "乳白色汁液很常见。榕属植物通常有木质茎，落叶后留下明显叶痕。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Milky sap can irritate skin, and plants within the family do not all share the same indoor care." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "乳白色汁液可能刺激皮肤，而且同科植物的室内养护方式并不完全相同。"
