    "New growth" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "长出新芽"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New Growth & Life Stages" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新芽与生长阶段"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New growth is a progress signal, not proof that every care condition is perfect. Read it together with the roots, older leaves, and potting mix." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "长出新芽说明植物正在前进，但不代表所有养护条件都完美。还要结合根系、老叶和盆土一起判断。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New leaves emerge as folded spears from the crown; damage to the single growing point can be serious." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新叶会从冠部以折叠的叶矛形态抽出；唯一生长点受损可能带来严重影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New leaves may look different" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新叶可能看起来不一样"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New plant" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新植物"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New stems and leaves often develop at the active tip of a shoot." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新的茎和叶通常会从活跃生长的枝梢长出。"
