          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On a very young root, this zone sits just behind the smooth growing tip and may look softly fuzzy." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在很幼嫩的根上，根毛区位于光滑生长根尖的后方，看起来可能带有柔软细绒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One clue alone is not proof. If you are unsure, gently slide out the root ball and look before choosing a larger pot." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "单凭一个迹象还不能确定。如果拿不准，可以轻轻取出根团查看，再决定是否换大盆。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One name, three useful pieces" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一个名称，三个实用部分"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One side may open before the other. Minor temporary wrinkles can smooth as the leaf expands." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶片两侧不一定同时展开。随着叶片继续伸展，轻微的暂时性皱褶可能会逐渐变平。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only when you tap Suggest with AI, limited text such as the plant name, existing species, and region when relevant is sent directly to OpenAI. Photos and plant history are not sent." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只有你主动使用 AI 建议时，PlantStory 才会把植物名称、已填写的物种，以及必要时的地区信息发送给 OpenAI。照片和植物记录不会发送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open a plant and choose Set a watering reminder in its Watering section." : {
