          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果照片带有拍摄日期，PlantStory 会自动填写。每次遇见同一种植物时，都可以记录地点和笔记。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Photo dates are filled from image metadata when available. You can adjust them, choose a timeline event, and add a note." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
