          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PlantStory couldn’t securely update the API key." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法将 API 密钥安全地保存到钥匙串。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PlantStory sends the plant name to OpenAI only after you request a suggestion. Each request uses your OpenAI API credits, and you’ll review the result before applying it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只有你主动生成建议时，PlantStory 才会把植物名称发送给 OpenAI。每次生成都会消耗你的 OpenAI API 额度，采用前可以先查看内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PlantStory sends the plant name, any species text you entered, and your device region when relevant. Photos, notes, and plant history are not sent." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PlantStory 只会发送植物名称、你填写的物种，以及必要时的设备地区。照片、笔记和植物记录不会发送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PlantStory uses no account, cloud database, or live cloud sync." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PlantStory 无需账户，也不会使用云端数据库或实时同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PlantStory was brought to life through ideas, conversation, and joyful experimentation with AI." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the open-source nature of PlantStory.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "PlantStory 诞生于一个个想法、一次次对话，以及和 AI 一起进行的快乐实验。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
