    "Recognize common houseplant pests and learn what to check." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "认识室内植物常见害虫，学会从哪里开始检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recognizing a consistent natural pattern makes it easier to notice genuinely new or unhealthy spots." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "熟悉稳定的天然斑纹后，就更容易发现新出现的异常斑点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recognizing normal variegation helps you avoid mistaking healthy color for a care problem." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "认出正常斑锦，可以避免把健康的叶色误认为养护问题。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recognizing stamens helps explain where pollen comes from during flowering." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "认识雄蕊后，就能明白植物开花时的花粉来自哪里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Record the plant and date, then watch for roots, new shoots, and signs of rot or drying." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "记下植物名称和日期，之后留意新根、新芽，以及腐烂或干枯的迹象。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Red-edge peperomia" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Red-edge peperomia"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Related plants may share traits, but they are not guaranteed to need identical care. Taxonomy is a clue, not a care schedule." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "亲缘相近的植物可能共享一些特征，但养护需求不一定完全相同。分类是线索，不是现成的养护表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remember" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "记住这一点"
