          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove soft dead roots with clean shears, use fresh well-draining mix and a clean draining container, then correct the watering or drainage problem." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用干净剪刀剪掉柔软坏死的根，换上新鲜透气的盆土和干净、排水良好的花盆，再解决浇水或排水问题。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove your API key?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要移除 API 密钥吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Removing spent flowers can redirect energy, but some plants need them to make seeds or fruit." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "剪去残花可以调整养分分配，但有些植物需要保留花朵才能结种或结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Removing the key immediately turns off AI suggestions. Everything else in PlantStory keeps working." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "移除密钥后，AI 建议会立即关闭，PlantStory 的其他功能不受影响。"
