          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Root hairs are fragile and short-lived. New ones continually form as a healthy root grows through the potting mix." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根毛脆弱且寿命很短；健康的根在盆土中生长时会不断形成新的根毛。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Root stress" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根系受损"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Root-hair zone" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根毛区"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rootbound" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根系满盆"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rooting speed varies widely by species, season, temperature, and method. Avoid disturbing the cutting repeatedly." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "生根速度会因品种、季节、温度和方法而相差很大，不要反复拔动插穗检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Roots" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Roots & repotting" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根系与换盆"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Roots anchor the plant and absorb water and dissolved minerals from the growing medium." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根固定植物，并从介质中吸收水分和溶解的矿物质。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Roots circle the root ball or grow through drainage holes" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根系绕满根团，或从排水孔长出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Roots densely circle the outside or bottom of the root ball, push through drainage holes, or leave very little potting mix visible." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根系密密地绕在根团外侧或底部，从排水孔钻出，几乎看不到盆土。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Roots develop in the material where the plant may continue growing, but progress is harder to see. Use a fresh, airy medium." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根会直接适应之后继续生长的环境，但生根进度不容易看见。要使用新鲜、透气的基质。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Roots feel firm and branch through the potting mix. Many species have cream, tan, or pale growing tips." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根摸起来结实，在盆土中自然分枝。许多植物的新根尖呈乳白、浅棕或其他浅色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Roots may have been damaged by long-lasting wet conditions, poor drainage, cold, excess fertilizer, or disease. Color alone does not confirm rot." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根系可能因长期潮湿、排水不良、低温、肥料过量或病害受损。仅凭颜色不能确定是否烂根。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
