        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "萼片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sepals can look like leaves, but their position beneath the flower identifies them." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "萼片看起来像叶子，但它们位于花朵下方，可以借此辨认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sepals protect the developing flower bud before the petals open." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "花瓣展开之前，萼片会包裹并保护正在发育的花芽。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Separate a rooted clump into complete plants" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把带根的植株分成几株完整小苗"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Separate it with a clean cut only when ready, preserve its roots, and place it in a small container with an appropriate fresh mix." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "等小苗准备好后再整齐切离母株，保留根系，并栽进装有合适新基质的小容器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Serrated edge" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "锯齿状叶缘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set a watering reminder" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置浇水提醒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set one interval year-round, or choose a different interval for each season." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "全年使用同一间隔，或为每个季节分别设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set the plant at its previous soil depth, then fill around it without packing the mix too firmly." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "植株保持原来的入土深度，填入盆土，但不要压得太实。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up watering reminder" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用建议设置浇水提醒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shape, color, openings, and edges are useful clues when identifying a plant." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶形、颜色、孔洞和叶缘，都是辨认植物的重要线索。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shapes" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶形"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Share a rating or a short App Store review." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 App Store 评分或写几句话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shoot tip" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "茎尖"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shorter days, lower light, cooler conditions, or the plant’s natural rhythm can slow new growth." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "日照变短、光线变弱、气温降低，或植物自身的生长节奏，都可能让新芽长得慢一些。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show less" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "收起"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show more (%lld)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "查看更多（%lld）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows locations already used by your plants" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "显示已记录过的摆放位置"
