            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最多查看 10 条历史记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows what this plant part does" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "了解这个植物部位的作用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Silver streaks and black specks" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "银白色擦痕和黑色小点"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skip watering for now. Use the reminder as a prompt to inspect again, not as an instruction to pour water." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "现在先不要浇水。把提醒当作再次检查的提示，而不是必须浇水的指令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slide the plant out" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "轻轻取出植株"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Small land plants that reproduce with spores" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "体型小巧，以孢子繁殖的陆生植物"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Small pests often feed along leaf undersides or new growth and distort the leaf as it opens." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "小型害虫常躲在叶背或新芽处取食，使展开的新叶变形。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Small tan or brown shell-like bumps stay fixed in place. Sticky honeydew, yellow leaves, or weak growth may follow." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "黄褐色或褐色的壳状小凸点会牢牢附着在植株上，随后可能出现蜜露、黄叶或长势变弱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Small, regular teeth run around the leaf margin like the edge of a saw." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶缘排列着细小而规则的齿，像锯子的边缘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Smooth, toothed, or wavy margins are useful clues when identifying a plant." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "光滑、锯齿状或波浪状的叶缘，都是辨认植物的重要线索。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Snake plant" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "虎尾兰"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Snake plant, spider plant, corn plant, ponytail palm, asparagus fern, and yucca." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "虎尾兰、吊兰、巴西木、酒瓶兰、天门冬和丝兰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Soft green, brown, or black insects crowd around new growth. Young leaves may curl, and white shed skins or sticky honeydew may appear." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "绿色、褐色或黑色的软体小虫常挤在新芽周围。嫩叶可能卷曲，还可能看到白色蜕皮或黏稠蜜露。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Soft or hanging leaves" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶片发软或下垂"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Soft, dark roots need a closer look" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "深色柔软的根需要仔细检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Soggy soil can damage roots, so the plant may droop even when the pot is wet." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "积水会伤害根系，因此即使盆土很湿，植物也可能下垂。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Soil" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "土壤"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some houseplants slow down when days are shorter, then resume stronger growth when light and conditions improve." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "日照变短时，有些室内植物会放慢生长；等光照和环境改善后，通常会重新活跃起来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some parent plants naturally produce pups, offsets, or plantlets. These can become independent plants once they have enough of their own structure and roots." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有些母株会自然长出侧芽或小苗。等它们具备足够完整的结构和根系，就可以独立生长。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some plants prefer a snug pot. Repot because the roots and watering behavior show a need—not just because a date arrived." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有些植物更喜欢稍紧的花盆。是否换盆要看根系和浇水状态，而不是只看日期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some plants push new leaves or small offsets from the crown or base instead of a vining tip." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有些植物不会从藤蔓末端发芽，而是从冠部或基部长出新叶和侧芽。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some plants regularly lose older leaves or slow their growth as conditions change." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有些植物会随季节和环境变化自然脱落老叶，或放慢生长速度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some roots look dark and feel soft, limp, or hollow. The plant may also wilt in wet mix, yellow, or lose vigor." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "部分根颜色发深，摸起来柔软、发塌或中空。植株也可能在盆土潮湿时仍萎蔫、黄叶或长势变弱。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
