      }
    },
    "Temperature and humidity" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "温度与湿度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tender growth appears folded or rolled" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "幼嫩的新叶以折叠或卷曲的形态冒出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tender leaves are often softer or lighter than mature foliage. Their color and texture may change as they expand." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新叶往往比成熟叶片更柔软、颜色更浅；随着叶片展开，颜色和质感也会继续变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test below the surface" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "检查表层以下"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thank you for helping this little garden grow." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "谢谢你陪这个小花园一起成长。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thank you!" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "谢谢你！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thanksgiving cactus" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "蟹爪兰"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The active season controls the current reminder. Change it whenever the season or your plant’s conditions change." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当前季节决定正在使用的提醒间隔。季节或养护环境变化时，请手动切换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The active season is shared by every plant. Change it in Settings under Watering Reminders." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当前季节由所有植物共用。请前往“设置”中的“浇水提醒”更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The anther is the pollen-bearing tip of a stamen." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "花药位于雄蕊顶端，是承载和产生花粉的部位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The area is brightly illuminated for much of the day while curtains, angle, or placement keep strong sunbeams off the leaves." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这里一天中大部分时间都很明亮，但窗帘、太阳角度或摆放位置让强烈阳光不会直接照到叶片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The area near the plant looks very bright, but you do not see a hard-edged patch of sun traveling across its leaves." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "植物周围看起来很明亮，但叶片上不会出现边缘清晰、随太阳移动的光斑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The begonia family is best known for asymmetrical leaves, colorful foliage, and showy flowers." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "秋海棠科最出名的是不对称叶片、多彩叶色和醒目的花朵。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The blade expands and opens. It may still look soft, pale, glossy, or slightly uneven while the tissue finishes developing." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶片开始伸展、打开。在组织尚未完全成熟时，它可能仍显得柔软、颜色较浅、有光泽，或略微不平整。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The blade is the broad, flat part of a leaf that captures most of its light." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶片是叶子宽阔而扁平的部分，承担大部分光线吸收。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The broad starting point in this simplified address. Many additional scientific ranks exist below it." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是简化分类地址的起点。往下其实还有许多更细的科学分类层级。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The brown dots beneath a healthy fern frond may be sori that produce spores—not necessarily pests or disease." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "健康蕨叶背面的褐色小点可能是产生孢子的孢子囊群，不一定是害虫或病斑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The color pattern usually repeats on healthy new leaves. Sudden irregular discoloration may instead signal stress or damage." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "健康的新叶通常会延续相似的色块。突然出现的不规则变色，则可能是养护压力或损伤。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The complete source code is open for you to download, explore, and build upon." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the open-source aspect of PlantStory.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "完整源代码已经开源，欢迎下载、研究，或在此基础上继续创作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The device-only Keychain item intentionally does not migrate. Add the key again under AI Suggestions if you still want that feature." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "出于安全考虑，API 密钥不会随备份迁移。如果还想使用 AI 建议，请在新 iPhone 上重新添加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The distinctive base notch is often more useful for identification than overall leaf size." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "辨认植物时，独特的叶基缺口往往比叶片大小更有参考价值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The family relationship does not make every aroid safe to eat; many contain irritating calcium oxalate crystals." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同属天南星科不代表可以食用；许多成员含有会刺激口腔和皮肤的草酸钙结晶。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The fig family includes woody tropical plants, many with milky sap and distinctive fruits." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "桑科包含许多木本热带植物，不少成员带有乳白色汁液，并结出独特的果实。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The genus and specific epithet together identify the species: Monstera deliciosa." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "属名与种加词合在一起，才构成完整的物种名称：Monstera deliciosa。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The growing tip lengthens the root, while a tiny root cap protects its tender cells as it moves through the potting mix." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "生长根尖让根伸长，微小的根冠则在根穿过盆土时保护娇嫩细胞。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The internode is the stretch of stem between two neighboring nodes." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "节间是茎上相邻两个节之间的一段。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The JSON backup includes My Garden, Wild Finds, photos, notes, timelines, and care history. It does not include your OpenAI API key or StoreKit purchase history. Restoring replaces the current local collection." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "JSON 备份包含“我的花园”和“野外拾趣”中的照片、笔记、成长记录及养护历史，但不包含 OpenAI API 密钥或 StoreKit 购买记录。恢复备份会替换本机现有数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The JSON backup includes My Garden, Wild Finds, photos, notes, timelines, and care history. Restoring replaces the current local collection." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "JSON 备份包含“我的花园”和“野外拾趣”中的照片、笔记、成长记录及养护历史。恢复备份会替换本机现有数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The key is stored in this device’s Keychain and is never saved with your plants. PlantStory sends a plant name to OpenAI only after you tap Suggest with AI." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "API 密钥只保存在这台设备的钥匙串中，不会写入植物数据。只有你轻点“让 AI 帮我补全”后，PlantStory 才会把植物名称发送给 OpenAI。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The leaf expands and begins to flatten" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶片逐渐伸展并摊开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The leaf firms up and reaches its working shape" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶片变得结实，长成完整形态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The leaf reaches its fuller size and working form. Its color and texture become more stable, though the final look varies by species." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶片逐渐达到完整大小和形态，颜色与质感也趋于稳定；最终模样会因品种而异。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The margin is the outer edge that defines the shape of the leaf blade." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶缘是叶片的外侧边界，也决定了叶片的轮廓。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The midrib is the main central vein that supports the blade and moves materials through it." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主脉是叶片中央最粗的叶脉，负责支撑并运输物质。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The mix feels wet below the surface and the pot is still heavy. Adding water now can keep air away from the roots." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "表层以下的盆土仍然湿润，花盆也很沉。此时继续浇水，可能会让根系缺少空气。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The nettle family ranges from stinging herbs to gentle tropical foliage plants such as Pilea." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "荨麻科既有会蜇人的草本，也有镜面草这类温和的热带观叶植物。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The number, depth, and shape of lobes can distinguish plants that otherwise look alike." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "裂片的数量、深浅和形状，可以帮助区分外观相近的植物。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The openings have smooth, finished edges and appear predictably as the plant matures, unlike ragged chewing damage." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "天然孔洞的边缘平滑，会随着植株成熟规律出现；虫咬留下的缺口通常参差不齐。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The ovary is the swollen flower structure that holds one or more ovules." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "子房是花朵中较膨大的结构，里面容纳一个或多个胚珠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pepper family includes compact tropical plants with fleshy leaves and slender flower spikes." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "胡椒科包含许多株形小巧的热带植物，常有肉质叶片和细长的穗状花序。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The petiole is the small stalk that connects a leaf blade to the stem." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶柄是连接叶片与茎的细小柄状结构。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The plant is losing more leaves than usual, sometimes while they are still green." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "植物落叶比平时更多，有时叶片尚未变黄就脱落。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The plant is top-heavy or roots are stressing the pot" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "植株头重脚轻，或根系已经挤压花盆"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The plant may be close to a gentler window or several feet back from a brighter one. The spot looks comfortably lit, not glaring." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "植物可能靠近光线柔和的窗户，或离明亮窗户有一段距离。这个位置看起来光线舒适，并不刺眼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The plant may be running out of room and water-holding potting mix. Some plants tolerate snug roots, so consider the plant’s overall behavior too." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "植物可能缺少生长空间和能保水的盆土。不过有些植物能适应紧凑根系，也要结合整体状态判断。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The plant receives steady indirect daylight, but not the strongest window light or prolonged direct sun." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "植物能持续获得散射自然光，但不会承受窗边最强的光线或长时间直射。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The plant’s bigger story" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "整株植物的成长故事"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The potting mix dries much faster than it used to" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "盆土比以前干得快很多"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The potting mix feels dry to the depth recommended for this plant, and the pot feels lighter than it does after watering." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "盆土已经干到这种植物适合浇水的深度，花盆也比刚浇透时轻。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The potting mix still feels cool or slightly damp below the surface. Many houseplants can wait, but moisture-loving species may differ." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "表层以下的盆土摸起来仍然凉爽或微湿。多数室内植物可以再等等，但喜湿植物可能不同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The reminder was saved, but PlantStory cannot alert you until notifications are enabled in iPhone Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提醒已保存，但需要先在 iPhone 设置中允许通知，PlantStory 才能提醒你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The right method depends on the species. A leaf that grows roots does not always have the tissue needed to grow a new shoot." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "合适的方法取决于植物品种。叶片长出根，并不代表它一定具备长出新芽所需的组织。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The room has daytime visibility without lamps, but the plant is well away from bright windows or near a window with major obstructions." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "白天不开灯也能看清房间，但植物离明亮窗户较远，或窗外有明显遮挡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The root crown is the transition point where the stem meets and branches into the root system." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根颈是茎与根系相连并开始分枝的过渡部位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The root system has air, moisture, and potting mix around it. A healthy plant does not automatically need a larger pot." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根系周围仍有空气、水分和盆土空间。植物根系健康，并不代表一定要换到更大的盆。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected file could not be read." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法读取这个文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The shoot tip contains the plant's active growing region, where new stem and leaves begin." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "茎尖包含植物活跃的生长区域，新茎和叶片从这里开始形成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The space receives limited natural light. Only plants that tolerate low light are likely to maintain healthy growth here." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个位置获得的自然光有限，只有耐低光照的植物较容易在这里维持健康生长。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The stamen is the pollen-producing structure made of a filament and an anther." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "雄蕊由花丝和花药组成，负责产生花粉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The stem supports the plant and carries water and sugars between roots and leaves." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "茎支撑植物，并在根和叶之间运输水分与糖分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The stigma is the receptive tip of the pistil where pollen can land." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "柱头位于雌蕊顶端，可以接收落下的花粉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The style is the stalk connecting the stigma to the ovary below." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "花柱是连接柱头与下方子房的柄状结构。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tip is the farthest point of the leaf blade from the petiole." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶尖是叶片上距离叶柄最远的末端。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tip jar is taking root" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "小小支持，暂时收好"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The young leaf becomes visible but stays compact. Folding or rolling protects tender tissue while it grows." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新叶已经露出来，但仍保持紧凑。折叠或卷曲的形态能在生长时保护幼嫩组织。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These are starting points, not universal rules. Learn how much drying your plant species prefers." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些只是判断起点，并非适合所有植物。还要了解你的植物喜欢盆土干到什么程度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These locations are inside PlantStory’s private app container and are not visible in the Files app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些文件位于 PlantStory 的私有 App 空间中，因此不会显示在“文件”App 里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These symptoms can have other causes. Check watering, roots, temperature, and pests before moving the plant again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些表现也可能由其他问题引起。再次移动植物前，先检查浇水、根系、温度和虫害。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They are the thinner lines branching outward from the central midrib." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从中央主脉向两侧分出的细线就是叶脉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They do not have the same vascular plumbing or true roots found in ferns and seed plants." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它们没有蕨类和种子植物那样的维管输送系统，也没有真正的根。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They usually branch below the soil, with fine roots spreading from thicker ones." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "根通常在土壤下方分叉，细根从较粗的根上向外延伸。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thick leaves, compact growth, and star-shaped flowers are common family traits." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "肥厚叶片、紧凑株形和星形花朵，都是这个科常见的特征。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thick structural roots anchor the plant and form the framework that supports smaller roots." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "粗壮的支撑根固定植物，并形成承托较小根系的骨架。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Think about any recent move or change in temperature, light, or watering." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "回想近期是否搬动过植物，或改变了温度、光照和浇水。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This API key was rejected. Check or replace it and try again." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个 API 密钥无法使用。请检查密钥，或更换后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This backup uses unsupported format version %lld. Update PlantStory and try again." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个备份的格式版本（%lld）暂不支持。请更新 PlantStory 后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This broad family includes many tough, architectural houseplants once placed in separate families." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是一个范围很广的家族，包含许多株形利落、适应力强的室内植物；其中不少过去曾被归入其他科。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This feature is not available in your App Store region." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此功能暂不适用于你所在的 App Store 地区。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is a beginner map of land plants—not every branch of the scientific tree." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是一张面向新手的陆生植物简图，并未列出科学分类树上的每条分支。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is a comfortable range for many foliage plants, but always check the care needs of the individual species." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "许多观叶植物都适合这个范围，但仍要查看具体品种的养护需求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This multiplication sign shows that a plant has a hybrid origin." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个乘号表示植物具有杂交来源。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This OpenAI account is temporarily rate limited or needs billing credits." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个 OpenAI 账户暂时受到调用频率限制，或 API 余额不足。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This purchase could not be completed. Please try again later." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "购买未能完成，请稍后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This removes the entry from %@’s history:\n%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This removes the entry from %1$@’s history:\n%2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将从 %1$@ 的记录中删除：\n%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This sends another request and uses additional OpenAI API credits. If the name and species have not changed, the new description will likely be similar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重新生成会再次发送请求，并消耗额外的 OpenAI API 额度。如果名称和物种没有变化，新描述通常也会很相似。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This sends another request and uses additional OpenAI API credits. If the plant name and species have not changed, the new suggestion will likely be similar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重新生成会再次发送请求，并消耗额外的 OpenAI API 额度。如果植物名称和物种没有变化，新建议通常也会很相似。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thousands of microscopic root hairs increase the surface area available to absorb water and dissolved minerals." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "数以千计的微小根毛扩大表面积，用来吸收水分和溶解的矿物质。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Three heart balloons floating over botanical leaves" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "三只爱心气球飘在绿叶上方"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thrips" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "蓟马"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Time" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "时间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Timeline event" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "事件标签"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tiny dark flies near soil" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在盆土附近飞动的小黑虫"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tiny dark flies run across or hover above damp potting mix. Adults are mostly a nuisance, but larvae live in the mix and may harm roots when numerous." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "小黑虫会在潮湿盆土上爬动或盘旋。成虫主要让人困扰，但幼虫生活在土中，数量很多时可能伤害根系。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tomorrow" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "明天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too dry or too wet?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "太干还是太湿？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too little light or a lasting nutrient shortage can cause broader yellowing." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "长期光照不足或缺少养分，可能导致更多叶片发黄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too much water" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "浇水过多"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Toxicity" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "毒性"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trace one of the thick roots spreading away from the crown before it divides." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "沿着一条从根颈向外伸展、尚未分枝的粗根观察。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trace the bare section of stem between two leaf attachment points." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "观察两个叶片连接点之间没有叶子的那一段茎。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trace the complete outside border of the leaf from its base to its tip." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从叶片基部一路沿着外侧边缘看到叶尖。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trace the outer edge. Deep curves reach inward, but the blade remains one connected leaf." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "沿着叶缘观察：凹口深入叶片，但整片叶仍连在一起。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Treat carefully" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "谨慎处理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Treatment applied" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已处理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tree philodendron" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "春羽"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trees, nearby buildings, screens, curtains, and roof overhangs can reduce window light." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "树木、邻近建筑、纱窗、窗帘和屋檐都会削弱窗边的光照。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "True palms are flowering plants with a single growing point and leaves commonly divided into leaflets." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "真正的棕榈是开花植物，通常只有一个生长点，叶片常分裂成许多小叶。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try a common name, scientific name, old name, genus, or family. Results stay on this device and work offline." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "输入俗名、学名、旧学名、属或科都可以。资料保存在本机，离线也能查询。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try a shorter name, an old scientific name, or a family such as Araceae." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "试试更短的名称、旧学名，或输入 Araceae 这样的科名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try again" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "再试一次"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try another care filter for this month." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请尝试本月的其他养护筛选条件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try another name or species." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "换个名称或物种试试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try another name, species, or location." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "换个名称、物种或地点试试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try this" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这样检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn off reminder for %@" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭%@的提醒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn the pot periodically if one side keeps leaning toward the light." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果植物总向光源一侧倾斜，可以定期转动花盆，让生长更均匀。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unavailable" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不可用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Understand indoor light, read plant signals, and find a better spot." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "认识室内光照，读懂植物信号，为它找到更合适的位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Understand symptoms and what to check first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "了解常见症状，并知道该先检查什么。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Understand your plants." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "读懂你的植物"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unfiltered sunlight reaches the foliage for part of the day. This is much more intense than a bright room." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一天中有一段时间，未经遮挡的阳光会直接照到叶片，强度远高于普通明亮房间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unfurling leaf" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶片展开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unusually long internodes can be a clue that a plant needs more light." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "节间异常拉长，可能说明植物需要更多光照。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use a clean container and fresh, airy propagation medium—or water when the species and method suit it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "准备干净容器和新鲜透气的繁殖基质；如果品种和方法合适，也可以用水培生根。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use a container with an open drainage hole so extra water can escape." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择有畅通排水孔的花盆，让多余水分能顺利流出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use a different key" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更换密钥"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use clean, sharp tools" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "工具要干净锋利"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use fresh potting mix suited to the plant instead of soil taken from the garden." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用适合该植物的新盆土，不要直接挖园土来种。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use reminders as a cue to check the soil—not as an instruction to water." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提醒只是请你查看土壤状态，并不代表一定要浇水。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use seasonal intervals" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按季节设置间隔"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the leaf, petiole, or leaf section specified for that plant. Keep track of which end is the base when orientation matters." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按该植物的要求选择叶片、叶柄或叶片切段；如果栽插方向很重要，要记清哪一端朝下。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use this for plants that are adapted to strong sun. Acclimate plants gradually because sudden intense light can scorch leaves." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只有适应强光的植物才适合直射阳光。要逐步适应，突然增强光照可能灼伤叶片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses lowercase and is italicized with the genus." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用小写字母，并与属名一起用斜体书写。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses the AI-recommended seasonal intervals. Existing reminder times are kept, and you can adjust the schedule later." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用 AI 建议的各季节间隔。已有提醒会保留原来的时间，之后也可以随时调整。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Usually a pause" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通常只是生长放缓"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Update" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Variegated" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "斑锦"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vascular plants with spores instead of seeds" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "具有维管组织，用孢子而非种子繁殖"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vein patterns can help identify plants and reveal some nutrient or watering problems." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶脉纹路能帮助辨认植物，也可能反映某些养分或浇水问题。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Veins" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶脉"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Veins carry water and sugars while forming a supportive network inside the leaf." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶脉在叶片内形成支撑网络，并运输水分和糖分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Velvet cardboard anthurium" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
