    "Wait and check again" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "先等等，之后再检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wait for several healthy roots or a rooted division that holds together. New shoot growth is another encouraging sign." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "等长出数条健康新根，或分株的根团已经稳固后再换盆；开始冒出新芽也是好信号。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wait for the mix to dry to the plant’s preferred level. If it stays wet unusually long, inspect drainage, light, pot size, and root health." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "等盆土干到植物适合的程度。如果它长时间不干，要检查排水、光照、花盆大小和根系状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warm, dry air usually speeds drying; cool or humid air usually slows it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "温暖干燥的空气通常会加快盆土变干；凉爽或潮湿的环境则会让它干得更慢。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watch a new leaf take shape." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "看一片新叶慢慢长成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watch for" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "留意事项"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watch for drainage" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "观察盆底出水"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watch the soil surface and nearby leaves after watering. A yellow sticky card near the pot can help confirm flying adults." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "浇水后观察土面和附近叶片。在花盆旁放一张黄色粘虫板，可以帮助确认是否有成虫。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watch the sun" : {
