    },
    "WILD FINDS" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "野外拾趣"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wild plant" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "野外植物"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wilting can happen when a plant is too dry or when damaged roots cannot take up water. Check the potting mix and roots before reacting." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "萎蔫既可能是缺水，也可能是根系受损后无法吸水。采取措施前，先检查盆土和根系。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Winter" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "冬季"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yellow leaves" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "叶片发黄"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can see a distinct patch of sunlight or a crisp shadow on or beside the plant when the sun reaches the window." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "太阳照进窗户时，植物叶片上或周围会出现清晰的光斑或轮廓分明的影子。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can see roots develop and monitor the water level. Move the cutting to mix before the water roots become a crowded tangle." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "水培方便观察新根和水位。不要等水生根挤成一团后才转入基质。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You do not need to memorize every rank. Start with family, genus, species, and cultivar—the names you are most likely to encounter as a plant owner." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不必背下每个分类层级。先认识科、属、种和栽培品种就够了，它们是养植物时最常遇到的名称。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You helped the PlantStory garden grow." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "谢谢你陪 PlantStory 的小花园一起成长。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You may also know it as" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你可能还听过这些名字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You stay in control" : {
